From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:34:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Timing and fuel compensation by gear, RPM x gear tables
 (pro-style)

New tables gearTimingTable (deg) and gearFuelTable (%) on gearCompRpmBins x
gearCompGearBins (gears 1-6). Timing goes into the advance corrections, fuel into the
running fuel corrections. Neutral, unknown gear or no gear detection: no change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
